              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoyada mwene Pasea, na Meshulaamu mwene Besodeia baahunduuza eirembo erya ira; baabyara enkingi zaaryo, baatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo by'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haataho Melatia owa Gibeoni, yaahunduuza na Yadoni owa Meronoosi, abashaija ba Gibeoni na Mizipa, abaabaire bari omu butegyeki bw'omutegyeki w'ensi eya seeri y'Omugyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haataho Uzieli, mwene Haruhaaya, ow'omu baheesi b'ezaabu, yaahunduuza. Haataho Hanania, omwe aha barikujwanzya emigaju, yaahunduuza. Bo baagaruraho orugo rwa Yerusaalemu okuhika aha Rugo orugango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haataho Refaaya mwene Huuri, omutegyeki w'ekicweka kya Yerusaalemu; yaahunduuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haataho Yedaaya mwene Harumaafu, yaahunduuza ahashungaine n'enju ye; haataho Hatushi mwene Hashabuneia, yaahunduuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malakiya mwene Harimu na Hashubu mwene Pahasi-moabu baahunduuza ekicweka ky'orugo, n'omunaara gw'amateekyero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haataho Shalumu mwene Haloheeshi, omutegyeki w'ekicweka kya Yerusaalemu, yaahunduuza, we na bahara be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hanuuni n'abatuuzi ba Zanoa baahunduuza eirembo ry'Oruhanga; baaryombeka, baatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo ey'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo; kandi baahunduuza ekicweka ky'orugo kya mikono rukumi okuhika aha irembo ry'orubungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malakiya mwene Rekabu, omutware w'eishaza rya Besi-hakeremu, yaahunduuza eryo irembo ry'orubungo; yaaryombeka, yaatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo eby'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
