            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.12.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 12:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Shalumu mwene Koluhoze, omutware w'eishaza rya Mizipa, yaahunduuza eirembo ry'enshuro; yaaryombeka, yaarishweka, yaatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo eby'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo; kandi yaayombeka orugo rw'ekiyanja kya Sheela, ekyabaire kiri omu musiri gw'omugabe, okuhika aha matembero, agarikushuuma nigaruga omu rurembo rwa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.20.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 20:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Haataho Nehemia mwene Azubuuki, omutware w'ekicweka ky'eishaza rya Besi-zuuri, yaahunduuza okuhika aharikureebana n'ebituuro bya Daudi, aha biyanja ebi baatibire, n'aha nju y'amamanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakuratwa Abaleevi; Rehumu mwene Baani, haataho Hashabia, omutware w'ekicweka ky'eishaza rya Keila, yaahunduuza ahabw'eishaza rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haataho beene waabo, baahunduuza; Bavai mwene Henadaadi omutware w'ekicweka ky'eishaza rya Keila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haataho Ezeri mwene Yehsua, omutware wa Mizipa, yaahunduuza ekindi kicweka, ekirikureebana n'ah'orikwinamukira nooza omu ibiikiro ry'eby'okurwanisa aha Keekubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
