              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Haataho Hanania mwene Shelemia, na Hanuni mutabani wa Zalafu owa mukaaga, baahunduuza ekindi kicweka. Haataho Meshulaamu mwene Berekia, yaahunduuza ahashungaine n'ekishengye kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
