          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakuratwa Malukiya, omwe aha baheesi b'ezaabu; yaahunduuza okuhika aha nju y'abaheereza by'omuri hekalu, n'ey'abashuubuzi, aharikureebana n'eirembo ry'eiteeraniro, n'okuhika aha kishengye kya ruguru eky'aha Keekubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
